#: scenario2:scenario2_E6D63425_B1F0_4B7A_BAE5_34918BDD6CFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8a19937c8ae291856a687ccaa47ebe1d74e550e287ef24dc196abed79b7c2fe
