msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E6D63425_B1F0_4B7A_BAE5_34918BDD6CFB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion’s corridor was a horrifically repulsive mess. ⟪k:1⟫Splatters of fresh beast "
"blood covered the walls, and there was a repugnant odor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il corridoio della villa era in condizioni orribili e ripugnanti.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Schizzi di sangue "
"fresco ricoprivano le pareti, e c’era un odore nauseante."

