msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Io— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Io—!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A177F07C_1047_463B_BCE9_0F87C9060DA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5cc52eed4a9d9e2baf57d6d7657475bfef84c2c9460e328c0c4fdec78a0b7fd6
#. default-sha256: 03641df09302e8b75684e1b85b9c051edac86ef170368e99bd82c788e5f8fad7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A177F07C_1047_463B_BCE9_0F87C9060DA4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What did he have to be so afraid of, though? ⟪k:1⟫He had exterminated the other beast "
"encroaching upon his territory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per quale motivo era così spaventato?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Aveva abbattuto la bestia che aveva invaso il "
"suo territorio."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6119AAA3_4E1D_4B90_842C_8C23AB59C05C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08891ddedffc2af5d190bc3b589b4efbcc77c3cf7fe61370995f3207126e92e6
#. default-sha256: 3adc638c94859e1c3dd30925c15c90d01515bf815b439e763129ae8d8b8768ad
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6119AAA3_4E1D_4B90_842C_8C23AB59C05C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would understand if he had puffed his chest in pride, but far from that, his terror merely "
"intensified."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avrei capito se avesse gonfiato il petto per l’orgoglio,⟪k:1⟫ invece era tutto⟪k:2⟫il "
"contrario; ⟪k:3⟫il suo terrore si era intensificato."

#: scenario2:scenario2_263D0D8F_3DA6_496C_A790_B2623928F622
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bffd71acac05795ea77802fc6f2a860ab7f9177245cdcffd94417bfee777ddb6
