msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DD4689FB_0486_4EB5_A3C2_1A6CB1819498"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl extended her hand for Bestia, but even her gentle, lovingly "
"outstretched fingers evoked fear in his eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi tese la mano verso Bestia, ma perfino⟪k:1⟫le sue dita gentili "
"e delicate evocavano paura nei suoi occhi."

#: scenario2:scenario2_400323D7_091A_4CF2_AE51_55BC14600017
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88d39ca78487600aff01b146ef2e44a0aa18a0171e67eccba54d5ac228c41de7
