msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_400323D7_091A_4CF2_AE51_55BC14600017"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Instinctively, he feared anything that entered his territory—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and then attempted to "
"remove it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Istintivamente, temeva qualsiasi cosa entrasse nel suo territorio—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫tentando "
"poi di scacciarlo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F3134CC1_A91B_453E_A199_F59C77EF4FD4
